/-! # Normalized word-image tensors of the identification Root8[8]- <-> Tenth[51]- (record
r8f:R87-, e = -1)

The net field values of the packed tensors `wR8fR87nTHX` and `wR8fR87nTGX` (divided by `2 ^ 13`
and `2 ^ 13`), stored as compact literals and certified by one cross-sum check per column; the
parts evaluate no word image. -/

